    "answer": {
      "short": "$213,\\ 243,\\ 273$",
      "worked": "Let $d$ be the missing digit. The digit sum is\n$$\\begin{align*}2+d+3&=5+d.\\end{align*}$$\nFor $0\\le d\\le9$, the multiples of 3 between 5 and 14 are $6,9,12$. Thus $d=1,4,7$, giving $213,243,273$.",
